        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lwi'mbo lwamwa Mose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose haki'mo na V'aizilaeli v'amwi'mbi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu lwi'mbo u'u'lu':",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo i'lo falasi zyamwa Falao haki'mo na mikokoteni zyakwe zya wu'lu'gu' na v'aliina falasi, aho ndi' v'ingi'la mu nyanza, Gu'ku' Mulungu wagasu'v'yaga minzi' ga mu nyanza, gav'akumbaga. Ali'vi V'aizilaeli ndi' v'av'i'ta ha nsi' nyu'mu hagati' na nyanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Miliamu, u'yo mufumbu'zi, ilu'mbu'ye na Aloni, wasolaga kagoma mu makono gakwe, na v'aki'ma v'angi' v'ose v'av'age v'amulondile na tu'goma twav'o ku'no v'ali'sapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Miliamu wav'atongelelaga lwi'mbo u'u'lu':",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Minzi' malu'lu'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wav'alondolaga V'aizilaeli ku'fuma ku' Nyanza ya Shamu, na kwingi'la ku' ibalangu' lya Shuli. V'ayu'mbaga lu'gendo lwa nsiku' idatu' mu ibalangu' nav'o v'akawine minzi', ninga madoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho v'afikaga ku' Mala, v'apotagwa ku'ganywa minzi' ga henanho ku'nguno ndi' malu'lu'. Yeni'yo hu' nguno ya ku'hitana henanho Mala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Mala” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wu'lu'lu'” ninga “wu'satu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'antu' v'amwisayi'li'li'laga Mose, ku' ku'yomba, “Ku'nywe ki'?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wamuli'li'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu, nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'laga ki'pande cha muti'. Haho Mose waki'tagi'laga mu minzi', nago minzi' gagalu'kaga na ku'v'a masoga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'apaga V'aizilaeli nhama na wu'yangu' ki'gele av'ageme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayombaga, “U'lu' mbe mugu'degeleke visoga muzwi gwanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, na ku'v'ezya ago gali'gelani'la ha mbele yanne, na ku'ku'zya nhama na milagi' zyanne zyose, hohene ene nkasye mmuletele malwile ki'ti' ago ndi' nav'afili'la V'amisili. Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'mupi'zya inywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho V'aizilaeli v'afikaga ku' lwandi' lwa Elimu, u'ko kwav'age na tu'sela iku'mi na tu'v'i'li', na miti' maku'mi mupungati' zya mitende. Nav'o v'awonaga v'atu'u'le nkambi' yav'o kwenu'ko bi'hi' na minzi'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
